OL,3,ANatalie Imbruglia on her worst
OL,4,Aaudition: 'I remember feeling icky'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen it comes to writing music, Natalie
OL,7,FImbruglia needs constant motion.
OL,9,F"I walk around in circles to get the
OL,10,Fmelodies, to catch them," the
OL,11,FAustralian singer says.
OL,13,F"If I'm sat in a chair, I get nothing.
OL,15,F"So if I go and work with someone new
OL,16,Fand they have a shoebox-sized studio,
OL,17,FI'm like, 'How am I going to do my
OL,18,Fcircles?'"
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
